{"title": "Broodmother's Revenge", "pageid": 3451, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Broodmother's_Revenge", "categories": ["Amulets", "Uncommon items", "Sources of Poison damage", "Poison set", "Self-Heal set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/4/48/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Broodmother's Revenge image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Broodmother's Revenge</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Amulet\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Amulet\">Amulet</a>. It coats the wearer's weapon in poison for 2 turns whenever they are healed.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Each of this amulet's jewels shines like a viper's eyes.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/38px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/50px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amulets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 65 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  65  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Healer_HealSelfPoisonWeapon_Amulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Healer_HealSelfPoisonWeapon_Amulet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Healer_HealSelfPoisonWeapon_Amulet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">21abc023-343a-4693-b63f-3ba07a231864</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:21abc023-343a-4693-b63f-3ba07a231864\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:21abc023-343a-4693-b63f-3ba07a231864\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Healer_HealSelfPoisonWeapon_Amulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Healer_HealSelfPoisonWeapon_Amulet+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Healer_HealSelfPoisonWeapon_Amulet+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Venomous_Revenge\" title=\"Venomous Revenge\">Venomous Revenge</a></dt><dd>Whenever the wearer is healed, their weapon becomes coated in magic and deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a>  damage.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Inner_Sanctum\" title=\"Inner Sanctum\">Inner Sanctum</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-461&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-22</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kagha\" title=\"Kagha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/25px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/38px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/50px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kagha\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/25px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kagha\" title=\"Kagha\">Kagha</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;235&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;44</span>: On a table of goods, owned by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Koll_(kobold)\" title=\"Koll (kobold)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png/25px-Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png/38px-Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png/50px-Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Koll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png/25px-Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Koll_(kobold)\" title=\"Koll (kobold)\">Koll</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item synergizes well with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derivation_Cloak\" title=\"Derivation Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derivation_Cloak\" title=\"Derivation Cloak\">Derivation Cloak</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoner%27s_Gloves\" title=\"Poisoner's Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoner%27s_Gloves\" title=\"Poisoner's Gloves\">Poisoner's Gloves</a>, especially when used by characters with high attack modifiers or multiple attacks per round.</li>\n<li>It is possible to obtain this item while keeping Kagha alive and friendly within the grove. During the confrontation with Kagha for the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_Kagha\" title=\"Investigate Kagha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Investigate Kagha\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_Kagha\" title=\"Investigate Kagha\">Investigate Kagha</a>, she must be convinced to side with the party. After celebrating with the tieflings in camp after <a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Refugees\" title=\"Save the Refugees\">defeating the goblin leaders</a>, Kagha will be standing alone, along the pathway entering the grove. Attacking her and knocking her out with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks\" title=\"Toggle Non-Lethal Attacks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks_Icon.webp/20px-Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks_Icon.webp/30px-Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks_Icon.webp/40px-Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Toggle Non-Lethal Attacks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks_Icon.webp/20px-Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks\" title=\"Toggle Non-Lethal Attacks\">Toggle Non-Lethal Attacks</a> makes her lootable yet keeps her alive. Following a long rest, Kagha will be awake again and upset, but non-hostile. Trading with her via bartering can bring her relationship with the party back into good standing.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Venomous Revenge:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Venomous Revenge applies to both melee and ranged weapons, but, as with all poison <a href=\"/wiki/Coatings\" title=\"Coatings\">coatings</a>, its effect does not work when a weapon is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a>.</li>\n<li>The effect is triggered even with full health or when being picked up from a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Downed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Downed</a> state.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The effect is triggered by:\n<ul><li>being targeted by any healing spell, like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Word\" title=\"Healing Word\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Healing_Word_Icon.webp/20px-Healing_Word_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Healing_Word_Icon.webp/30px-Healing_Word_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Healing_Word_Icon.webp/40px-Healing_Word_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Healing Word\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Healing_Word_Icon.webp/20px-Healing_Word_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Healing_Word_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Word\" title=\"Healing Word\">Healing Word</a>.</li>\n<li>consuming any healing items, like a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Potion of Healing</a>, a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Goodberry_(Item)\" title=\"Goodberry (Item)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/FOOD_Goodberry_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-FOOD_Goodberry_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/FOOD_Goodberry_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Goodberry_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/FOOD_Goodberry_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Goodberry_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/FOOD_Goodberry_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-FOOD_Goodberry_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/FOOD_Goodberry_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Goodberry_(Item)\" title=\"Goodberry (Item)\">Goodberry</a>, or a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raspberry\" title=\"Raspberry\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/FOOD_Raspberry_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-FOOD_Raspberry_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/FOOD_Raspberry_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Raspberry_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/FOOD_Raspberry_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Raspberry_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/FOOD_Raspberry_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-FOOD_Raspberry_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/FOOD_Raspberry_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raspberry\" title=\"Raspberry\">Raspberry</a>.</li>\n<li>all equipment with continuous regeneration effects: the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helm_of_Balduran\" title=\"Helm of Balduran\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helm_of_Balduran\" title=\"Helm of Balduran\">Helm of Balduran</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Regeneration\" title=\"Ring of Regeneration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Ring_of_Regeneration_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Regeneration\" title=\"Ring of Regeneration\">Ring of Regeneration</a>.</li>\n<li>healing effects from the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derivation_Cloak\" title=\"Derivation Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Derivation_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derivation_Cloak\" title=\"Derivation Cloak\">Derivation Cloak</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Landfall\" title=\"Armour of Landfall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Landfall\" title=\"Armour of Landfall\">Armour of Landfall</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li>The effect is <em>not</em> triggered by:\n<ul><li>Most self-healing effects from equipment: <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Flail\" title=\"Shattered Flail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Shattered_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Flail\" title=\"Shattered Flail\">Shattered Flail</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_of_Chaos\" title=\"Sword of Chaos\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Greatsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Greatsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greatsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Greatsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Greatsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Greatsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/Greatsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sword_of_Chaos\" title=\"Sword of Chaos\">Sword of Chaos</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Woe\" title=\"Woe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Woe\" title=\"Woe\">Woe</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Robe_of_the_Weave\" title=\"Robe of the Weave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Robe_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Robe_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Robe_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Robe_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Robe_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Robe_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Robe_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Robe_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Robe_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Robe_of_the_Weave\" title=\"Robe of the Weave\">Robe of the Weave</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Ward_Armour\" title=\"Psionic Ward Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Psionic_Ward_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Psionic_Ward_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Psionic_Ward_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Psionic_Ward_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Psionic_Ward_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Psionic_Ward_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Psionic_Ward_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Psionic_Ward_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Psionic_Ward_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Ward_Armour\" title=\"Psionic Ward Armour\">Psionic Ward Armour</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation\" title=\"Vest of Soul Rejuvenation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation\" title=\"Vest of Soul Rejuvenation\">Vest of Soul Rejuvenation</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish\" title=\"Circlet of Mental Anguish\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish\" title=\"Circlet of Mental Anguish\">Circlet of Mental Anguish</a>, or <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wapira%27s_Crown\" title=\"Wapira's Crown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wapira%27s_Crown\" title=\"Wapira's Crown\">Wapira's Crown</a>.</li>\n<li>Healing from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/20px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/30px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/40px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Transfuse Health\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/20px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\">Transfuse Health</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li>This effect interacts in the following ways with <a href=\"/wiki/Dip\" title=\"Dip\">dipping</a> and coatings:\n<ul><li>The effect overwrites <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dipped_in_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Dipped in Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dipped in Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dipped_in_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Dipped in Fire (Condition)\">Dipped in Fire</a> and vice versa.</li>\n<li>The effect does not trigger for an already coated weapon (e.g. <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drow_Poison\" title=\"Drow Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/COAT_Drow_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Drow_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/COAT_Drow_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-COAT_Drow_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/COAT_Drow_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-COAT_Drow_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/COAT_Drow_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Drow_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/COAT_Drow_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drow_Poison\" title=\"Drow Poison\">Drow Poison</a>).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Coatings\" title=\"Coatings\">Coatings</a> overwrite the effect.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quest\">Related quest</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icont